# Pelagos Bank API: the requests the portal makes, for Visual Studio, Rider or VS Code (REST Client).
# The same requests work in Postman (signed out): copy the method, URL, headers and body.
# Start the lab first: dotnet run (from app/Pelagos.Api), then click "Send request" above each block.

@host = http://localhost:15080

### Is the lab up?
GET {{host}}/health

### Log in as a seeded customer (every seeded customer has PIN 0000)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "customer001@pelagos.example", "password": "0000" }

### Your own account (customer 1 owns account 1), using the token from the login above
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Find a customer by name
GET {{host}}/api/customers/search?name=Customer%20002
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
